{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GzhN8wxZYi1794812923.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>專門投資科技股的易方資本投資組合經理王逸研指出，輝達前行政總裁黃仁勳以往積極扶持新興雲商，包括為它們作信用擔保，他辭職後，市場擔心有關股份資金來源斷裂。王逸研預料，年底前科技股繼續不明朗，已提前減低長倉倉位。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:14:45.432753+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T03:00:33.518578+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:08:09.422852+00:00","content_hash":"85f878440630f6efe1731aa7010daf4a1273075ed3191ab1470f7a14cb7e4bae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:14:45.432753+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}